		z-index: 1;
		transition: background 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
	}

	/* Read dots: small filled, muted */
	.toc-dot-link.read .toc-dot {
		background: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.25);
		border-color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.25);
		transform: scale(0.7);
